                <head>No. 8.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker
                        to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic">March 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Consul Braida telegraphs fifty English soldiers landed Bluefields; strongly urged
                    American warship.</p>
            </div>
